From 072704b116f233d01df6bfe02cc38f9d72016d7c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 22:54:31 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Add a stable debug key and a debug-only screen inspector

- Sign debug builds with a committed, non-secret debug key so a new CI-built APK
  installs over the previous one (the .gitignore gets a narrow exception for it).
- Add a debug-only inspector that saves the TikTok accessibility tree to a local
  text file (accessibility button or optional auto capture), with an in-app screen
  to view, share (zip) and delete dumps. Screen texts are reduced to their length
  unless the user opts in. The release build gets a no-op InspectorHook.
- The accessibility service only gains four one-line calls to InspectorHook.
- Unit tests for the dump format and the file naming/retention rules.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XyhKbsAcrys94eFYAmnCyS
